{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00507","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀雨师乐章 迎神 · 包佶","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀雨师乐章 迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陟降左右，诚达幽圜。\n作解之功，乐惟有年。\n云軿戾止，洒雾飘烟。\n惟馨展礼，爰列豆笾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}